msgid ""
"There are several ways of donating to ArduPilot and all donations large and "
"small help us keep things running smoothly. The preferred method is a paypal"
" donation to the ArduPilot Foundation, which is an Australian non-profit "
"incorporated association."
msgstr ""
"向ArduPilot捐款的方式多种多样，无论大小，所有捐款都有助于我们保持平稳运营。首选方式是通过PayPal向ArduPilot基金会捐款，该基金会是一家澳大利亚非营利社团法人。"

